      "author": "Saoirse Lindgren",
      "text": "INC-70866 is not charged \u2014 PRB-4121 reclassified it. The March 26 quorum loss (26 minutes) leaves the 30-day window on the 25th.",
      "ts": "2026-04-14T11:30:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Adaeze Nkemelu",
      "text": "Orrinwave will not support a split upgrade: mixed-version clusters are unsupported, so all three brokers restart in one session.",
      "ts": "2026-04-14T11:36:00"
    },
    {
      "author": "Tunde Abara",
      "text": "A budget exception for an earlier date would be mine and nobody has asked. The notice length is what customer comms publish, so it has to fit the budget as a whole.",
      "ts": "2026-04-14T11:48:00"
    }
  ],
